    ["<Assistant_Title1>【铁路大亨】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>铁路大亨</>是城堡中的独立玩法。你需要消耗<Assistant_Property1>经销许可证</>开启线路，携带城堡工坊产物作为初始资本，在不同站点之间<Assistant_Property1>低买高卖</>，赚取<Assistant_Property2>商会票券</>并在结算时兑换为城堡货币。\n<Assistant_Title2>核心流程：</>选择难度与携带物产 → 签订经销协议 → 逐站买卖货物 → 选择策略卡 → 完成协议目标 → 终点结算评级与奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[铁路大亨-参与与准备]|905}，{SendAnswer:[铁路大亨-交易技巧]|906}，{SendAnswer:[铁路大亨-经销协议]|907}，{SendAnswer:[铁路大亨-策略卡与路线]|908}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Instructions: </><Assistant_System>Railway Tycoon</> is an independent game mode within the Castle. You need to consume <Assistant_Property1>Distribution Licenses</> to open routes, carry Castle Workshop products as initial capital, <Assistant_Property1>buy low and sell high</> between different stations, earn <Assistant_Property2>Chamber of Commerce Tickets</>, and exchange them for Castle currency upon settlement.\n<Assistant_Title2> Core Process: </>Select difficulty and cargo → Sign distribution agreements → Buy and sell goods station by station → Choose strategy cards → Complete agreement goals → Final settlement rating and rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Railway Tycoon-Participation and Preparation]|905}, {SendAnswer:[Railway Tycoon-Trading Tips]|906}, {SendAnswer:[Railway Tycoon-Distribution Agreements]|907}, {SendAnswer:[Railway Tycoon-Strategy Cards and Routes]|908}",
